# Fragment: the Exynos 9810's hardware video decoder (MFC v10) on a phone whose own configuration leaves it out (the Note9).
# EXPERIMENT: the S9's driver; mfc_fw.bin comes from the phone's own VENDOR partition (the Note9's is there, 682192 bytes).
# The driver is built in; it does nothing until mfc=5 is on the command line (the loader also keeps 128 MB out of XNU's RAM for it).
CONFIG_HAKIOS_EXYNOS_MFC=y
